# SCRADMIN.C: backup, restore, pack, reindex, the audit log and the
# sessions (MZ_).
# W=74 prompt box titles: VID_COLS - 6
580 MZ_T_BACKUP Back up the data
581 MZ_T_RESTORE Restore the data from a backup
# W=33 prompt label beside its 40-cell field: VID_COLS - 7 - 40
582 MZ_L_DIR Directory

583 MZ_RESTOREQ Replace all the data with the backup in ^1? This cannot be undone.
584 MZ_PACKQ Remove the deleted records for good and rebuild every index? This cannot be undone.
585 MZ_WAIT Working; with much data this takes minutes...
586 MZ_BACKEDUP Data backed up to ^1
587 MZ_RESTORED Data restored from ^1
588 MZ_PACKED Data packed; records removed: ^1
589 MZ_REINDEXED Every index rebuilt
590 MZ_NODIR Directory ^1 not found
591 MZ_NOBACKUP No complete backup in ^1
592 MZ_DIRERR Backup or data directory: ^2
# W=74 form box title: VID_COLS - 6
593 MZ_T_AUDIT Audit log
# W=5 form label: AU_V1 - AU_C1 - 1
594 MZ_L_TBL Table
# W=6 form label: AU_V2 - AU_C2 - 1
595 MZ_L_REC Record
# W=7 form label: AU_V3 - AU_C3 - 1
596 MZ_L_STA Station
# W=79 key hints: VID_COLS - 1, level digits not counted
597 MZ_HINTFORM Enter=Show Esc=Back F1=Help
598 MZ_HINTLIST Esc=Filter F1=Help
# W=78 list header: VID_COLS - 2
599 MZ_HDR  Date       Time  User     Table    Record A Field      Old value  New value

600 MZ_EMPTY No audit rows
601 MZ_NEEDTBL A record needs its table
# W=74 box title: VID_COLS - 6
602 MZ_T_SESS Sessions
# W=78 column header: VID_COLS - 2
603 MZ_SHDR  Slot Type Station          User     Level State             Idle
# W=79 key hints: VID_COLS - 1, level digits not counted
604 MZ_SHINT F5=Refresh Esc=Back F1=Help
# W=15 session states 0..3: SS_STATEW
605 MZ_STATE0 Connected
606 MZ_STATE1 Not logged in
607 MZ_STATE2 Password change
608 MZ_STATE3 Logged in
